OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day with plenty of sunny
OL,6,Fspells and variable amounts of cloud,
OL,7,Fperhaps becoming mostly sunny during
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,9,Fsunshine with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with mostly clear skies,
OL,12,Fleading to a chilly night with light
OL,13,Fwinds. A grass frost is possible by
OL,14,Fdawn for any prone rural spots.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FAnother dry day with plenty of
OL,17,Fsunshine, though perhaps turning
OL,18,Fcloudier across the north of the
OL,19,Fregion during the afternoon. Patchy
OL,20,Fmist and fog possible overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
