OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud and sunny spells
OL,7,FTuesday. Mostly cloudy on Wednesday
OL,8,Fbut most areas staying dry. Fine and
OL,9,Fsunny Thursday. Warm by day, but
OL,10,Fchilly Wednesday and Thursday nights.
